    "title": "The Other Spain",
    "projectEntryName": "Tour Booking E-Commerce",
    "projectEntryDescription": "The Other Spain is a premium travel e-commerce platform offering curated tours across Spain for international travelers. The product focuses on high-value itineraries that combine iconic destinations with lesser-known locations. These tours often represent multi-thousand-euro purchases, making the booking experience a complex decision process. My role was to redesign the platform to improve product discovery, trip planning and booking conversion.",
