      {
        "__component": "project.project-description",
        "id": 71,
        "text": "The Other Spain is an e-commerce specializing in luxury tours and in this project I was tasked with giving the brand a new look so that it exuded an exclusive and elegant yet accessible feel I also helped conceptualize the UX prototypes and designed the purchase flow and an interactive map for selecting tours including the entire visual part of the website and the design system."
      }
