    "title": "Demócrata",
    "projectEntryName": "Democrata",
    "projectEntryDescription": "Demócrata is a digital newspaper focused on parliamentary and institutional political coverage. Its digital product felt outdated and struggled to connect with younger readers accustomed to faster and more interactive news consumption. The goal of the project was to modernize the digital experience while preserving the credibility and trust associated with political journalism, and to explore how AI could enhance understanding of complex political information.",
