      {
        "__component": "project.project-description",
        "id": 74,
        "text": "The objective of this project was to develop a complete brand redesign and give it a fresher cleaner and more minimalist look contrasting with the current tendency to oversaturate news media with content we sought an elegant image to maintain a serious aspect for older generations yet a fresh and modern appearance to attract new generations of readers and in this project I was responsible for the complete brand redesign the UI design and the creation and management of the complete design system."
      }
